  "question": {
    "text": "The number of values of <math><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for which the system of linear equations<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />has a non-trivial solution, is:"
